One important design principle is:

The module should contain infrastructure resources. The calling/root configuration should contain provider configuration, backend configuration, environment-specific values, and the module block.

I have also started organizing this in your existing GitHub repository, gopal1409/terraform-aws-blue-green-module-july10; the repository currently already has a terraform-bluegreen-aws/modules structure.

