2. Important changes from your original code

There are a few things I would change before making this a reusable module.

Original
variable "subnet_cidr_block" {
  default = "10.0.1.0/24"
}

You don't need this because you already have:

variable "subnets" {
  type = map(object({
    cidr_block        = string
    availability_zone = string
  }))
}

So remove subnet_cidr_block.

Original backend

You had:

terraform {
  backend "s3" {
    bucket = "gopal-terraform-state-2026"
    key    = "dev/gopal.tfstate"
    region = "us-east-1"
    encrypt = true
    use_lockfile = true
  }
}

Do not put this inside the reusable module.

Backend configuration belongs to the root/calling configuration:

examples/dev/backend.tf

That allows the same module to be used by:

dev
test
stage
prod

with different state files.

