Step 2 — Put the GitHub module source in main.tf

For example:

module "networking" {

  source = "git::https://github.com/gopal1409/terraform-aws-blue-green-module-july10.git//modules/networking?ref=v1.0.0"

  project_name = var.project_name

  environment = var.environment

  vpc_cidr_block = var.vpc_cidr_block

  subnets = var.subnets

  common_tags = local.common_tags
}

Terraform automatically downloads the module from GitHub during:

terraform init
