The most important teaching point

The separation is:

MODULE
│
├── networking
├── security-group
├── compute
└── alb

while the local/root project only consumes the modules:

main.tf
   │
   ├── module.networking
   ├── module.security_group
   ├── module.compute
   └── module.alb

So you can later reuse exactly the same GitHub modules for:

dev
qa
staging
production

by changing only the root project's variables and terraform.tfvars.
